      "id": "claim_4f110a679458468cba8e8aa789d18253",
      "statement": "The Cargo workspace separates reusable runtime/macro crates from product crates: `rung` and `rung-macro` form the public type-ladder runtime/macro split; `rung-agent-core`, `rung-agent`, `rung-memory`, `rung-host`, and `rung-gateway` are product-side components.",
